# Cloudflare redirects (Workers static assets & Pages).
# Docs: https://developers.cloudflare.com/workers/static-assets/redirects/
#
# Format: <source> <destination> [status]   (status defaults to 302)
# Rules run top-down, first match wins; put static rules before dynamic ones
# (splats "*" -> ":splat", placeholders ":name"). URLs have no trailing slash
# (trailingSlash: "never" in astro.config.ts). Examples (uncomment to use):
#
# /old-page        /new-page                301
# /blog/*          https://blog.example.com/:splat  301
# /team/:name      /about#:name             301
